  "verseCount": 67,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbrahama wayeseluphele eseleminyaka eminengi; iNkosi yayimbusisile kukho konke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbrahama wathi encekwini yakhe enkulu yendlu yakhe, ephatha konke alakho: Beka isandla sakho ngaphansi kwethangazi lami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizakukufungisa iNkosi, uNkulunkulu wezulu loNkulunkulu womhlaba, ukuthi kawuyikuyithathela indodana yami umfazi emadodakazini amaKanani engihlala phakathi kwawo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa uzakuya elizweni lakithi lasezihlotsheni zami, uyithathele khona umfazi indodana yami uIsaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku yathi kuye: Uba owesifazana engavumi ukuza lami kulelilizwe, ngiyise indodana yakho elizweni owavela kulo na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbrahama wathi kuye: Qaphela ukuba ungayibuyiseli khona indodana yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi, uNkulunkulu wezulu, eyangikhupha endlini kababa laselizweni lokuzalwa kwami, yafunga kimi yathi: Ngizalinika inzalo yakho lelilizwe; izathuma isithunywa sayo phambi kwakho, ukuze uyithathele khona umfazi indodana yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba owesifazana engavumi ukubuya lawe, uzakuba ukhululekile kulesisifungo sami; kodwa ungayibuyiseli indodana yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku yasibeka isandla sayo ngaphansi kwethangazi likaAbrahama inkosi yayo, yafunga kuye ngalindaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku yasithatha amakamela alitshumi kuwo amakamela enkosi yayo, kanye lenhlobo zonke ezinhle zempahla yenkosi yayo, yasisuka isiya eMesopotamiya emzini kaNahori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaguqisa amakamela ngaphandle komuzi ngasemthonjeni wamanzi ntambama, ngesikhathi abaphuma ngaso abesifazana ukukha amanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi: Nkosi, Nkulunkulu wenkosi yami uAbrahama, ungiphumelelise lamuhla, uyenzele inkosi yami uAbrahama umusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kangela, sengimi ngasemthonjeni wamanzi, kuza amadodakazi amadoda omuzi ukukha amanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuthi intombi engizakuthi kuyo: Beka phansi imbiza yakho unginathise, iphendule ithi: Natha, ngizakunathisa lamakamela akho; kayibe yiyo oyikhethele uIsaka inceku yakho; ngalokho ngizakwazi ukuthi uyenzele inkosi yami umusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ingakaqedi ukukhuluma, kwehla uRebeka owayezalwa nguBethuweli indodana kaMilka, umkaNahori umfowabo kaAbrahama, ebeke imbiza yakhe ehlombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intombi yayinhle kakhulu, iyintombi engayaziyo indoda; yehlela ngasemthonjeni, yagcwalisa imbiza yayo, yakhuphuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku yasigijima ukuyihlangabeza yathi: Nginathisa amanzi embizeni yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi: Natha, nkosi. Yaphangisa yehlisela imbiza yayo esandleni, yayinathisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiqedile ukuyinathisa yathi: Ngizakukhelela lamakamela akho aze akholwe wonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaphangisa yathululela amanzi ayo emkolweni, yabuya yagijimela emthonjeni ukuyakukha, yakhelela amakamela wonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indoda yasithula iyikhangelisisa ukuba ibone ukuthi iNkosi ibiphumelelisile indlela yayo yini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi amakamela eseqedile ukunatha, indoda yasithatha icici legolide, ubunzima balo buyingxenye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", lamasongo amabili egolide ezandleni zayo, ubunzima bawo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " alitshumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi: Uyindodakazi kabani na? Ngitshela. Kukhona indawo endlini kayihlo ukuba singenise khona na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi kuyo: Ngiyindodakazi kaBethuweli indodana kaMilka owazalwa nguNahori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi kuyo futhi: Silotshani lokudla kwamakamela okunengi, kanye lendawo yokulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indoda yasikhothamisa ikhanda layo, yadumisa iNkosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yathi: Kayibongwe iNkosi, uNkulunkulu wenkosi yami uAbrahama, engayekelanga ukuyenzela inkosi yami umusa lobuqotho; lami iNkosi ingiholile endleleni ngaze ngafika endlini yesihlobo senkosi yami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intombi yagijima, yatshela abendlu kanina lezizinto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "URebeka wayelomnewabo obizo lakhe lalinguLabani; uLabani waphuma wagijimela kuleyondoda ngasemthonjeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esebonile icici lamasongo ezandleni zikadadewabo, esezwile amazwi kaRebeka udadewabo okuthi: Itsho njalo indoda kimi; waya kuleyondoda eyayimi kuwo amakamela ngasemthonjeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: Ngena wena obusisiweyo yiNkosi; umeleni ngaphandle na? Ngoba sengilungisile indlu lendawo yamakamela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leyondoda yasingena endlini, yakhulula amakamela. Amakamela anikwa utshani lokudla, kwalethwa amanzi okugeza inyawo zayo lenyawo zamadoda ayelayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabekwa ukudla phambi kwayo ukuba idle; kodwa yathi: Kangiyikudla ngingakakhulumi indaba yami. Wathi: Khuluma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi: Ngiyinceku kaAbrahama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi iyibusisile kakhulu inkosi yami, yaze yaba nkulu. Yayinika izimvu lezinkomo, isiliva legolide, izinceku lezincekukazi, amakamela labobabhemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USara umkankosi yami wayizalela inkosi yami indodana esemdala; yayinika konke elakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yami yangifungisa yathi: Ungayithatheli indodana yami umfazi kuwo amadodakazi amaKanani, engihlala elizweni lawo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa uye endlini kababa lasezihlotsheni zami, uyithathele khona indodana yami umfazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngathi enkosini yami: Mhlawumbe owesifazana kayikungilandela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi kimi: INkosi, engihamba phambi kwayo, izathuma isithunywa sayo lawe, iphumelelise indlela yakho; uzakuyithathela indodana yami umfazi ezihlotsheni zikababa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwalokho uzakhululeka esifungweni sami uba ufika ezihlotsheni zami zingakuniki yena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuthe ngifika emthonjeni lamhla, ngathi: Nkosi, Nkulunkulu wenkosi yami uAbrahama, akuphumelelise indlela yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khangela, sengimi ngasemthonjeni wamanzi; kakuthi intombi eza ukukha engizakutsho kuyo: Nginathisa amanzi embizeni yakho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iphendule ithi kimi: Natha wena, ngizakhelela lamakamela akho; kayibe nguye owesifazana iNkosi emkhethele indodana yenkosi yami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngingakaqedi ukukhuluma ngenhliziyo yami, kufike uRebeka ethwele imbiza yakhe ehlombe; wehlela emthonjeni, wakha. Ngasengisithi kuye: Akunginathise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waphangisa, wethula imbiza yakhe ehlombe wathi: Natha, ngizanathisa lamakamela akho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngambuza ngathi: Uyindodakazi kabani? Wathi; Ngiyindodakazi kaBethuweli, indodana kaNahori ozalwa nguMilka; ngasengifaka icici emakhaleni akhe lamasongo ezandleni zakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhothamisa ikhanda lami, ngayidumisa iNkosi, ngabonga iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenkosi yami uAbrahama, ebingihole endleleni elungileyo ukuba ngiyithathele indodana yenkosi yami indodakazi yomfowabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khathesi uba lithanda ukuyenzela inkosi yami umusa lobuqotho, ngitshelani; uba lingathandi, ngitshelani, ukuze ngiphendukele ngakwesokunene loba ngakwesokhohlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebephendula oLabani loBethuweli bathi: Lokhu kuvela eNkosini; kasilakutsho lutho kuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khangela, uRebeka uphambi kwakho; mthathe uhambe, abe ngumkandodana yenkosi yakho njengokutsho kweNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi isizwile amazwi abo inceku kaAbrahama yakhothamela emhlabathini phambi kweNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku yakhupha izinto zesiliva, lezinto zegolide, lezambatho, yakunika uRebeka, yabanika lomnewabo lonina impahla eligugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebesidla benatha, yona lamadoda ayelayo, balala khona. Sebevukile ekuseni, yathi: Ngivumelani ngibuyele enkosini yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa umnewabo lonina wentombi bathi: Ake ihlale lathi intombazana okwensukwana, mhlawumbe ezilitshumi, andubana ihambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi kubo: Lingangibambeleli, lokhu iNkosi iphumelelisile indlela yami; ngivumelani ukuba ngiye enkosini yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathi: Asimbize umntwana, sizwe kuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebembiza uRebeka, bathi kuye: Uzahamba lalindoda na? Wathi: Ngizahamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebemvumela ukuhamba uRebeka udadewabo lomlizane wakhe, lenceku kaAbrahama lamadoda ayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bambusisa uRebeka, bathi kuye:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
