          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaka wayesedabule inkangala waze wafika emthonjeni waseLahayi‐Royi, ngoba wayehlala elizweni laseNegebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaka waphuma ntambama ukuba ahambahambe emmangweni; waphakamisa amehlo akhe wabona amakamela esiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LoRebeka waphakamisa amehlo akhe; esembonile uIsaka wehla ekameleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi encekwini: Ngubani lindoda ehamba emmangweni ukusihlangabeza na? Inceku yathi: Yinkosi yami. Wasethatha isimbombozo sakhe, wazigubuzela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku yasimtshela uIsaka konke ebikwenzile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 24:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaka wamngenisa ethenteni lakhe, wamthatha uRebeka, waba ngumkakhe. UIsaka wamthanda, waseduduzeka emva kokufa kukanina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.24.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.24.67"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
